\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa120\b\f0\fs22 YzControl 1.7.1 - Software License\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs18 This software controls a pan-tilt unit (gimbal), IP cameras and ICOM radios, and predicts amateur-satellite passes using the SGP4 model. It is provided for amateur radio and educational use.\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs18 1. Use this software only in compliance with the radio regulations of your country and with a valid amateur radio licence where required. You are responsible for every transmission you make.\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs18 2. The pan-tilt commands move real hardware. Keep the antenna clear of people and obstacles, and keep the azimuth limit (0-355 deg) in mind before starting automatic tracking.\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs18 3. Orbital data (TLE / OMM) and transponder data are downloaded from third-party public services (CelesTrak, DTRAC / SatNOGS). Their accuracy is not guaranteed; predictions are for reference only.\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs18 4. The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The author is not liable for any damage to equipment, antennas, radios or property arising from its use.\par
